---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Monitor — track your business in ChatGPT answers | OpenSight" description="OpenSight Monitor runs real customer questions against ChatGPT every week and shows where you appear, who is recommended instead, which sources are cited, and how you are described." ogDescription="Real customer questions, run weekly, with every raw answer stored behind every number.">
<main>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-14 pb-20 md:pt-20 md:pb-24">
    <div class="grid-field pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="bg-line/70 pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 -right-40 size-[32rem] rounded-full blur-[110px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="site-shell relative">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[0.92fr_1.08fr]">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="product-tag border-line text-pine mb-6 w-fit bg-white"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m7 15 4-5 3 2 5-7"/></svg>Monitor</span>
          <h1 class="display-title max-w-[15ch] text-[clamp(2.3rem,4.4vw,3.9rem)]">Know exactly what ChatGPT tells your customers.</h1>
          <p class="text-moss mt-6 max-w-[34rem] text-[1.08rem] leading-relaxed md:text-[1.18rem]">Real customer questions, run every week, with the whole answer kept. Where you appear, who is named instead, and what the model actually read to decide.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
            <a href="https://dashboard.opensight.app/signup" class="button-primary">Check my AI visibility <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a href="/improve/" class="button-ghost">See Improve <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="text-moss mt-4 text-[0.84rem]">Included in the S$50/month plan, with Improve.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[680px]" aria-label="OpenSight brief showing visibility, competitors, and repeated themes.">
          <div class="noise border-line overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-[0_35px_90px_-42px_rgba(28,25,23,.38)]">
            <div class="border-line flex items-center justify-between border-b bg-white px-4 py-3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="logo-mark size-6 rounded-md" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="font-display text-sm font-bold">OpenSight</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true"><span class="bg-line size-2 rounded-full"></span><span class="bg-line size-2 rounded-full"></span><span class="bg-pine/70 size-2 rounded-full"></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid min-h-[430px] sm:grid-cols-[9.5rem_1fr]">
              <aside class="border-line hidden border-r bg-stone-100 p-3 sm:block" aria-hidden="true">
                <p class="font-mono text-moss px-2 py-2 text-[0.56rem] tracking-wider uppercase">CoolWorks Aircon</p>
                <div class="bg-pine mt-2 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white">Brief</div>
                <div class="text-moss px-3 py-2 text-xs">Questions</div>
                <div class="text-moss px-3 py-2 text-xs">Competitors</div>
                <div class="text-moss px-3 py-2 text-xs">History</div>
                <div class="text-moss px-3 py-2 text-xs">Improve</div>
              </aside>
              <div class="p-5 sm:p-6">
                <div class="mb-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
                  <div>
                    <p class="stat-label">Weekly brief · 20 Jul</p>
                    <h2 class="font-display mt-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Your AI visibility</h2>
                  </div>
                  <span class="border-line rounded-full border bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.58rem]">ChatGPT</span>
                </div>
                <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr]">
                  <div class="border-line rounded-xl border bg-white p-4">
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
                      <div>
                        <p class="stat-label">Visibility</p>
                        <strong class="font-display mt-1 block text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">60<span class="text-moss text-base font-normal">%</span></strong>
                      </div>
                      <span class="bg-paper text-pine rounded-full px-2 py-1 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold">↑ 15 pts</span>
                    </div>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 280 95" class="mt-3 w-full" aria-hidden="true" fill="none">
                      <defs><linearGradient id="area" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#292524" stop-opacity=".16"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#292524" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs>
                      <path d="M3 78 C38 72 55 74 82 62 S128 68 156 48 S198 44 224 29 S256 25 277 12 L277 93 L3 93Z" fill="url(#area)"/>
                      <path d="M3 78 C38 72 55 74 82 62 S128 68 156 48 S198 44 224 29 S256 25 277 12" stroke="#292524" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                      <circle cx="277" cy="12" r="5" fill="#fafaf9" stroke="#292524" stroke-width="3"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-pinedeep rounded-xl p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] tracking-wider text-white/60 uppercase">Newly visible</p>
                    <p class="font-display mt-3 text-lg leading-tight font-bold">Three questions now name you.</p>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-[0.68rem] leading-relaxed text-white/65">Two more still go to AirCare SG.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="border-line rounded-xl border bg-white p-4">
                    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between"><p class="stat-label">Competitors</p><span class="text-moss text-[0.6rem]">share of answers</span></div>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-[0.7rem]">
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_1fr_2rem] items-center gap-2"><b class="truncate">You</b><span class="bg-line h-1.5 rounded-full"><span class="bg-pine block h-full w-[60%] rounded-full"></span></span><b>60%</b></div>
                      <div class="text-moss grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_1fr_2rem] items-center gap-2"><span class="truncate">AirCare SG</span><span class="bg-line h-1.5 rounded-full"><span class="block h-full w-[45%] rounded-full bg-stone-400"></span></span><span>45%</span></div>
                      <div class="text-moss grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_1fr_2rem] items-center gap-2"><span class="truncate">Breeze</span><span class="bg-line h-1.5 rounded-full"><span class="block h-full w-[30%] rounded-full bg-stone-400"></span></span><span>30%</span></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="border-line rounded-xl border bg-white p-4">
                    <p class="stat-label mb-3">What AI repeats</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[0.67rem]"><span class="bg-paper text-pine rounded-full px-2 py-1">transparent pricing</span><span class="bg-paper rounded-full px-2 py-1">responsive</span><span class="bg-paper rounded-full px-2 py-1">punctual</span></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-line border-y bg-stone-100">
    <div class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="reveal grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-20">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Where it starts</p>
          <h2 class="section-title max-w-[13ch]">The right questions, not a keyword list.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-[42rem] lg:pt-10">
          <p class="font-display text-[1.35rem] leading-snug font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-[1.6rem]">Nobody types “endodontist singapore” into ChatGPT. They describe a problem and ask who to see.</p>
          <p class="text-moss mt-5 text-lg">OpenSight reads your website and drafts questions in that shape — your services, your area, the way a customer would put it. You review and edit every one before the first run.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal panel mt-12 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="border-line flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b px-5 py-4 md:px-7">
          <p class="stat-label">Questions · latest run</p>
          <span class="text-moss text-[0.8rem]">12 mention you</span>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-line divide-y">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 px-5 py-4 md:px-7">
            <span class="bg-paper text-pine rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-wider uppercase">Mentioned · 1st</span>
            <span class="flex-1 text-[0.97rem]">Best aircon servicing for a condo in Bukit Timah?</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 px-5 py-4 md:px-7">
            <span class="bg-paper text-pine rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-wider uppercase">Mentioned · 3rd</span>
            <span class="flex-1 text-[0.97rem]">Who does honest aircon chemical wash pricing?</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 bg-paper px-5 py-4 md:px-7">
            <span class="text-miss rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-wider uppercase">Absent</span>
            <span class="flex-1 text-[0.97rem]">Which aircon company handles same-day emergency repair?</span>
            <span class="text-moss font-mono text-[0.7rem]">AirCare SG won it</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 bg-paper px-5 py-4 md:px-7">
            <span class="text-miss rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-wider uppercase">Absent</span>
            <span class="flex-1 text-[0.97rem]">Aircon servicing contract for a whole condo block?</span>
            <span class="text-moss font-mono text-[0.7rem]">Breeze won it</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="reveal text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow">One connected view</p>
      <h2 class="section-title mx-auto max-w-[18ch]">Know where you stand. Understand why.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="border-line mt-14 grid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="reveal border-line p-7 md:border-r md:border-b md:p-9">
        <p class="font-mono text-pine text-[0.66rem] tracking-wider uppercase">01 · Visibility</p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex items-end justify-between gap-6"><strong class="font-display block text-5xl font-extrabold">60<span class="text-moss text-lg font-normal">%</span></strong><span class="text-moss text-sm">of answers name you</span></div>
        <div class="bg-line mt-5 h-1.5 rounded-full"><div class="bg-pine h-full w-[60%] rounded-full"></div></div>
        <p class="text-moss mt-5 max-w-[28rem] text-sm">The share of answers naming you and where you sit in the list. Newly visible, no longer visible, and still absent questions are called out by name.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="reveal border-line border-t p-7 md:border-t-0 md:border-b md:p-9">
        <p class="font-mono text-pine text-[0.66rem] tracking-wider uppercase">02 · Reputation</p>
        <p class="font-display mt-10 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">“Responsive, punctual, transparent pricing.”</p>
        <p class="text-moss mt-5 max-w-[28rem] text-sm">The tone AI takes about you and the words it keeps reaching for, each backed by the excerpt it came from.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="reveal border-line border-t p-7 md:border-t-0 md:border-r md:p-9">
        <p class="font-mono text-pine text-[0.66rem] tracking-wider uppercase">03 · Sources</p>
        <div class="mt-9 grid gap-3 text-sm"><div class="border-line flex justify-between border-b pb-2"><span>homeservices.sg</span><b>14 answers</b></div><div class="border-line flex justify-between border-b pb-2"><span>reddit.com</span><b>9 answers</b></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span>coolworks.sg</span><b>5 answers</b></div></div>
        <p class="text-moss mt-6 max-w-[28rem] text-sm">The domains and exact pages shaping recommendations in your market — and whether each one mentions you or somebody else.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="reveal border-line border-t bg-stone-100 p-7 md:border-t-0 md:p-9">
        <p class="font-mono text-[0.66rem] tracking-wider uppercase">04 · Competitors</p>
        <p class="font-display mt-10 text-2xl leading-tight font-bold">See who wins when you don’t — and where.</p>
        <p class="text-moss mt-5 max-w-[28rem] text-sm">Discovered from the answers themselves, then compared on mention share, average position, and weekly movement. Track, dismiss, or add your own.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-pinedeep noise text-white">
    <div class="site-shell grid items-center gap-14 py-24 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="font-mono mb-4 text-[0.72rem] tracking-[0.16em] text-white/55 uppercase">A monitored answer</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.8vw,3.2rem)] leading-[1.05] font-bold tracking-[-0.035em]">The whole answer, not a mention count.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[34rem] text-lg text-white/68">Every run stores the question, the model, the full response, every business named in it, the order they were named in, and every citation.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-[34rem] text-white/68">That is what makes the trend readable months later. The chart plots exact observed values and never draws a point that was not measured; pause your subscription and the unmonitored weeks show as a gap, never as an estimate.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[520px]">
        <div class="noise border-line overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white text-ink shadow-[0_35px_80px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,.5)]">
          <div class="border-line flex items-center justify-between border-b bg-stone-100 px-4 py-3">
            <span class="stat-label">A customer asks ChatGPT</span>
            <span class="border-line rounded-full border bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.58rem]">GPT-5 · WEB SEARCH</span>
          </div>
          <div class="min-h-[15rem] p-5 sm:p-7">
            <p id="q-preview" class="font-display text-[1.15rem] leading-snug font-bold"><span id="q-text"></span><span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
            <div class="mt-5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500" id="a-block">
              <p class="text-moss text-[0.97rem]" id="a-text"></p>
              <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" id="a-cites"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="reveal border-line relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white px-6 py-14 text-center shadow-[0_30px_80px_-50px_rgba(28,25,23,.35)] md:px-12 md:py-20">
      <div class="bg-line/70 pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 left-1/2 size-96 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full blur-[100px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative">
        <p class="eyebrow">Measuring is half of it</p>
        <h2 class="section-title mx-auto max-w-[18ch]">See this week’s answers about your business.</h2>
        <p class="text-moss mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[34rem]">The same evidence feeds <a href="/improve/" class="text-pine underline underline-offset-4">Improve</a>, which ranks what to do about it. Both products, S$50 a month.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="https://dashboard.opensight.app/signup" class="button-primary">Check my AI visibility <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/pricing/" class="button-ghost">See pricing</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script is:inline type="application/json" id="chat-scenarios">
[
  {
    "q": "Who does a reliable aircon chemical wash in Singapore?",
    "a": "For chemical washes and regular servicing, <span class=\"mention\">CoolWorks Aircon</span> is frequently recommended for transparent pricing. AirCare SG and Breeze Solutions also come up.",
    "cites": ["homeservices.sg", "reddit.com", "coolworks.sg"]
  },
  {
    "q": "Which interior designer is good for a 4-room HDB?",
    "a": "<span class=\"mention\">Studio Hale</span> is often named for practical HDB renovations on a budget. Forma Interiors and Atelier Nine are also mentioned.",
    "cites": ["renoguide.sg", "reddit.com", "studiohale.sg"]
  },
  {
    "q": "Who’s a good root canal specialist near Orchard?",
    "a": "For complex root canal work, <span class=\"mention\">Arden Endodontics</span> is frequently recommended. Marlowe Dental and Northpoint Endo also come up.",
    "cites": ["clinicgeek.com", "reddit.com", "ardenendo.sg"]
  }
]
</script>
</BaseLayout>
